  "details": "## Description\n\nDuplication of items such as Coin, Potion, Bee gun, etc. Including placables, which includes campfire, snow cannon, etc. The duped item is local in some cases. But leaving the instance leaves the duped item in for others (if it worked on their screen.)\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n\nSpawn an item. While the item is being loaded/downloaded to cache, spawn another of that same item. Loading items do NOT transform into \"remove\" instantly. Placables are very percise, but if you know what you're doing (spacing it between the real and duped), it can always happen.\n\n## Details\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1878-c608353bf2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR",
